<h1>Support the Online Book of Common Prayer</h1>
<p><strong>How you can help</strong><br>
<p>If you have found the BCP site to be a blessing, and feel inclined to give a
gift of any sum, please consider giving to the Clergy Discretionary Fund* at <a href="https://stalbanswickenburg.com/" target="_blank">
        St. Alban's Episcopal Church</a>
    in Wickenburg, AZ, where the programmer serves as vicar. These donations will help to care for
    those experiencing food and financial insecurity in the community. </p>
<p>Whatever your inclination, please enjoy the site.</p>
<p>* (Open <a href="https://secure.myvanco.com/L-ZMJ5/home"
               target="_blank">Giving Site</a>, select
    "Special Giving" and in the Note field, specify "Clergy Discretionary Fund.")</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><strong>Helpful Resources</strong></p>
<p>Finally, if you are looking for other versions of the BCP on the internet, please see this <a href="http://justus.anglican.org/resources/bcp/bcp.htm" target="_blank">link</a>, as it contains numerous sources for other versions of the BCP, both in web format (HTML), and other useful formats.</p>
